  "notes": {
    "values": "Every param is stored normalised 0..1 (enums as their index; mto is a bit mask of Motion targets: 1 Window, 2 Pitch, 4 Pan, 8 Grain position, 16 Echo, 32 Room, 64 Crunch). map exp = min*(max/min)^v; sq = min + v*v*(max-min).",
    "macros": "Front controls wish values for the back knobs; each knob ends at the weighted average of its own value and the wishes (macro_mix), each Temperature link scaled by its s_* knob. Temperature and Air ease in like a slow spring, the same for everyone.",
    "tape": "The tape is not a param: the page writes it with fwm_sample_alloc / fwm_sample_set (never in the song). px / pz place Mica (pan, distance); eff px / pz are where she is after walking. Classic / Reverse play the trimmed part once; with loop = Loop it repeats and every new pass fades in over lfade.",
    "viz": "fwm_viz: [tape play position 0..1 or -1, motion, compressor dB, 8 × (note or -1, level), event count, events × (tape position 0..1, note)]."
  }
}
